"description":"Immerse yourself in a calm, productive atmosphere with Lofi Bear — your cozy companion for studying, working, and unwinding.\n\nLofi Bear combines lofi music playlists with a customizable pomodoro timer to help you stay focused and productive while maintaining balance.\nKey Features:\n\nFocus with Lofi Music:\nStream relaxing lofi beats across genres like Chill, Study, Beats, Ambient, and Dreamy — perfect for deep work or winding down.\n\nCustom Pomodoro Timers:\nStay productive with built-in timers designed to enhance your focus sessions. Customize focus time, break lengths, and sessions to fit your workflow.\n\nLIsten to Ambient Sounds: \nAmplify your study sessions with different ambient sounds to focus to.\n\nNotifications:\nEnable notifications to gently remind you when it's time to take a break or start your next session.\n\nPersonalized Timers:\nChoose from different timer types and colors to match your mood and tasks.\n\nCreate your own peaceful study haven — one session at a time.\n\nDownload Lofi Bear today and let the music guide your focus!\n\nThis app is free with the option to upgrade to Premium. Lofi Bear Premium gives you access to additional features:\n-You can subscribe to this app to get access to pomodoro customization, unlimited song skips, and genre selection.\n-Subscription options are: 1-month with 3-day free trial, 1-year .\nLinks to our Terms of Use and Privacy Policy can be found below:\nhttps://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\nhttps://www.privacypolicies.com/live/11ad9f47-6e2c-4302-9ed3-6cfe0d4bfecc", "averageUserRating":4.48979999999999979110043568653054535388946533203125, "trackCensoredName":"Lofi Bear: Pomodoro Timer", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/lofi-bear-pomodoro-timer/id6742638645?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "minimumOsVersion":"17.2", "genreIds":["6007", "6011"], "primaryGenreName":"Productivity", "primaryGenreId":6007, "genres":["Productivity", "Music"], "userRatin