"description":"Lofi Music 24/7 Hiphop Radio: Work & Study, Music for Studying & Reading\n\nFind your perfect focus, relaxation, or inspiration zone with Lofi Music & Radio, your ultimate destination for calm and creativity. Our app brings you nonstop 24/7 lofi hip hop radio streams, carefully curated to help you study, work, read, or simply unwind after a long day.\n\nKey Features:\n\n- 24/7 streaming lofi hip hop stations with no interruptions  \n- Chill, ambient, and carefree beats to boost focus and reduce stress  \n- A curated library of relaxing tracks by talented indie artists from around the world  \n- Minimalist, user-friendly interface that won’t disrupt your flow  \n- Background audio support — keep listening while using other apps  \n- Ideal for studying, reading, working, meditating, or relaxing\n\nWhether you’re grinding through tasks or taking a moment to breathe, our music creates the right atmosphere to support your mental clarity and peace of mind.\n\nPerfect for students, creatives, freelancers, and anyone who values calm in their daily life.\n\nStep into a world of sound where every beat is crafted to help you feel better, think deeper, and live calmer. Download Lofi Music & Radio today and elevate your daily routine with music that soothes, inspires, and flows.\n\n\nTerms of service: https://demoledorappsterms.blogspot.com/2023/11/terms-conditions-devapps.html\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://demoledorapps.blogspot.com/2017/12/privacy-policy-for-mobile-applications.html\n\nDisclaimer:\n\nAll songs used in this app are governed by fair use guidelines. This app is an unofficial fan-based app. No copyright infringement is intended, and any request to remove a track will be honored. If you have any questions, please email: aalfredosapon@gmail.com\n\nVisual assets enhanced using Magnific.com", "averageUserRating":4.75, "trackCensoredName":"Lofi Music: 24/7 Hip Hop Radio", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/lofi-music-24-7-hip-hop-radio/id64786964